@startuml 09-contract-states
' UML state machine: the life of a contract (ADR-0007). Every transition is an SQL function called by the API.
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40

[*] --> Draft : Départ started

state Draft
Draft : details saved as they are typed
Draft : the vehicle status doesn't change
Draft --> [*] : discarded (no number yet)\n/ draft deleted, audited

state "Awaiting signature" as Awaiting
Awaiting : « En attente de signature »
Awaiting : number reserved · vehicle held
Awaiting : values, photos, damage or language\ncan change: new preview, same number (F-26)
Draft --> Awaiting : preview created\n/ number MCR-YYYY-NNNN reserved (F-18)
Awaiting --> Active : client draws once in the app\n/ PDF stamped and sealed\n/ revision 1 frozen\n/ vehicle → rented
Awaiting --> Void : never signed\n« Annulé avant signature »\n/ number kept, vehicle free

state Active {
  state "On rental" as OnRental
  state "Retour in progress" as ReturnInProgress
  [*] --> OnRental
  OnRental --> OnRental : amendment\n/ new revision, recorded in the app,\nnot printed (F-22)
  OnRental --> ReturnInProgress : Retour started
  ReturnInProgress : saved as it is typed
  ReturnInProgress : client absent → « en attente de signature »\n  ReturnInProgress : can change before the signature (F-26)\n  ReturnInProgress : stored signature waiting, if switched on (F-28)
}

ReturnInProgress --> Closed : client signs the Retour (mandatory, F-04)\nor staff apply the stored signature (F-28)\n/ vehicle → available
OnRental --> Void : voided before any Retour,\nwith a reason\n/ vehicle → available

state Closed
Closed : never edited
Closed : kept until the retention rules apply (L-07)
state Void
Void : never edited
Void : PDFs watermarked « ANNULÉ / VOID »
Closed --> [*]
Void --> [*]
@enduml
